argin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>第 03 篇 · 对齐时代：让模型「被驯服」</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>导读</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 02 篇的 GPT-3 很强大，但也很危险：随口编造事实、吐露有害内容、对着简单问题答非所问。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>能力（capability）不等于可用（alignment）。</span></strong><span>&nbsp;2022 年起，行业把重心从「更大」转向「更听话」——这就是对齐时代。本篇是理解 ChatGPT 为什么能火、Claude 为什么强调安全、以及今天所有 AI 产品的「价值观」从哪来的钥匙。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>WHY</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、为什么需要对齐（Alignment）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.1 预训练目标 ≠ 人类需求</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>预训练只优化一件事：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>预测下一个 token</span></strong><span>。这个目标会带来三个偏差：</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>偏差</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>表现</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>不求有用</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>诚实但废话连篇：「我不知道」也要硬编一段</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>不求安全</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>中性回答，同样概率给出危险操作步骤</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>不求风格</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>冷冰冰的统计语言，不像「助手」</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：对齐 = 在「会说话」和「说人话」之间架桥</span></strong><span>预训练回答「什么词最可能」，对齐回答「什么回答最有帮助且安全」。后者本质是</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>价值观工程</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、第一套系统解法：RLHF（OpenAI，2022）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.1 InstructGPT 三步走（RLHF 标准流程）</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>第 1 步 SFT（监督微调） &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第 2 步 奖励模型 RM &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第 3 步 强化学习 RL</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>人类写「指令→理想回答」 &nbsp;→ &nbsp; 人类对多份回答打分 &nbsp; &nbsp;→ &nbsp; 用 RM 当老师，PPO 更新模型</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>SFT</span></strong><span>：拿一批人工写的高质量「指令-回答」对，先微调模型（让它会「听指令」）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>奖励模型（RM）</span></strong><span>：让标注员给同一指令的多份回答</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>排序</span></strong><span>，训练一个打分器——把「人觉得好不好」变成可优化的标量；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>PPO 强化学习</span></strong><span>：用 RM 给模型输出的回答打分，通过 RL 让模型学会「高分行为」。为避免模型乱改，加了 KL 惩罚约束它与原模型不过度偏离。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.2 效果与意义</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>InstructGPT 仅 13 亿参数，但人类偏好胜率显著超过 1750 亿的 GPT-3——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>证明对齐是「能力放大器」</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>ChatGPT（2022-11）＝ GPT-3.5 基座 + RLHF 打磨 → 引爆全球；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>代价：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>贵</span></strong><span>。每轮 RL 都要 RM 打分 + 多次前向，且 RM 本身就是人工标注训练出来的。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：RLHF 的哲学 = 「找个人工老师」</span></strong><span>模型的「好坏标准」由人类标注决定，再让强化学习把这个标准内化。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>优点</span></strong><span>：标准清晰；</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>缺点</span></strong><span>：标注贵、且「标准本身」也被模型学了偏见。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、第二条路：Constitutional AI（Anthropic，2022）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>3.1 问题：RLHF 的「老师」还是人</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>Anthropic 的洞察：与其让人一遍遍打分，不如</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>给 AI 一部「宪法」</span></strong><span>，让它自我批评、自我修订——人只写原则，不写答案。</span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>3.2 两步法</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>监督阶段（RLAIF）</span></strong><span>：模型先输出回答 → 按宪法原则自我批评 → 修订成符合宪法的版本 → 用这些「修订数据」微调模型；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>RL 阶段</span></strong><span>：用「违反宪法程度」当奖励信号（AI 反馈替代人类反馈）——即 RLAIF（AI Feedback 强化学习）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>3.3 意义</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>标准显式化</span></strong><span>：宪法是公开的原则清单（helpful/harmless/诚实等），可审查、可迭代；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>省人力</span></strong><span>：打分从「人排」变成「AI 自评」；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Claude 的血统</span></strong><span>：Claude 系列从 1 代起就是这条路的实践者（对应 Anthropic 家族系列将详讲）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：RLHF vs 宪法 AI =「人工打分」 vs「规则自评」</span></strong><span>一个依赖人工标准，一个把标准写成条文。今天的主流已趋同：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>先有原则清单，再让模型自评</span></strong><span>（DPO/GRPO 都吸收了这个思想）。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、DPO：把 RL 砍掉（2023）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>4.1 核心洞察</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>RLHF 的强化学习环节又贵又抖。DPO（Direct Preference Optimization）证明：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>不需要单独的奖励模型 + PPO，直接拿「偏好数据」做监督学习即可</span></strong><span>——因为 RL 的最优策略，其实可以解析地写出来。</span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>4.2 做法</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>输入：人类偏好的数据对（回答 A 好于回答 B）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>目标：让模型</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>直接</span></strong><span>提高「好回答」的似然、压低「差回答」的似然，同时约束与参考模型不过度偏离；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>结果：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>训练稳定、省算力、无 RM 无 RL</span></strong><span>——对齐成本大幅下降。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>4.3 影响</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Vicuna/Zephyr 等开源模型迅速跟进（这也是 README 规划表里列 Vicuna 的原因）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>为 DeepSeek 的 GRPO 铺路：R1 用「基于规则/可验证奖励」的 GRPO 做</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>纯强化学习</span></strong><span>训练推理（第 05 篇详讲）——两者结合 = 对齐与推理一体的今日格局。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：DPO 的哲学 = 「把偏好看成数据，而不是看成流程」</span></strong><span>RLHF 把对齐做成多阶段流程，DPO 把它简化成「用偏好对做一次分类训练」。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>流程越简单，越可复制</span></strong><span>——这是开源对齐能普及的关键。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、对齐的未竟问题</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>标准谁来定</span></strong><span>：RLHF 的人类标注、宪法 AI 的宪法、DPO 的偏好对——背后都是「某群人的价值观」；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>对齐税</span></strong><span>：过度对齐可能损害能力（过拟合「讨好」）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>对齐 ≠ 安全</span></strong><span>：能拒绝 ≠ 不会出事故——需要可解释性与红队（对应 rule 体系里的安全防护思路）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>六、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>对齐动机</span></strong><span>：预训练优化「预测」，不优化「有用/安全」——能力与可用之间的鸿沟。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>RLHF 三步</span></strong><span>：SFT → 奖励模型 RM → PPO 强化学习（OpenAI InstructGPT，ChatGPT 的底座）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>宪法 AI</span></strong><span>：用公开原则清单让模型自我批评修订（Anthropic，Claude 的血统）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>DPO</span></strong><span>：去掉 RM + PPO，用偏好对直接监督学习——简单可复制（2023 开源标配）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>DeepSeek 衔接</span></strong><span>：GRPO = 用规则奖励做纯 RL 训练推理（R1）；对齐与推理在 DeepSeek 合流。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>6</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>未竟问题</span></strong><span>：标准主权、对齐税、对齐≠安全。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>09</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>七、下一篇预告</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 04 篇：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>效率革命</span></strong><span>——对齐解决了「乖不乖」，但模型太贵：千亿参数推理一次要租几块 A100。2021 年起行业开始「抠」：MoE 稀疏化（Switch/Mixtral/DeepSeek-V2）、量化（GPTQ/AWQ）、蒸馏、长上下文工程（ALiBi/RoPE）。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>DeepSeek-V3 是这场革命的集大成者——这是它的家族系列的立身之本。</span></strong></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>10</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Training language models to follow instructions with human feedback（InstructGPT, Ouyang et al., 2022）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.02155</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Constitutional AI: Harmlessness from AI Feedback（Bai et al., 2022）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.08073</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Direct Preference Optimization（Rafailov et al., 2023）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.18290</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[参考] 人类反馈如何塑造 ChatGPT（OpenAI 官方博客翻译解读）：</span><span>https://openai.com/research/instruction-following</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据原论文。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>",
 "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:34:55+0800"
